# Anzrag's Rampage counts artifacts "put into graveyards from the battlefield this turn" for any reason, tokens included
# (its ruling). Before it, Bot1's Blooming Blast, with the gift promised, gives Bot2 a Treasure token and kills Bot2's
# Ornithopter (an artifact creature): that is one artifact put into a graveyard. The Rampage then destroys the Treasure
# token, which goes to the graveyard for a moment and counts too: X = 2, and the top two cards, both creatures, are exiled.
# "You may put a creature card exiled this way onto the battlefield": Bot1 declines, so both stay in exile and nothing
# is returned to hand at the end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Blooming Blast
Mountain
Mountain
Anzrag's Rampage
Llanowar Elves
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

